Description: network monitor for the hibr desktop: see every byte, per app
 wiretap shows what your machine sends and receives: live graphs, the
 busiest apps, history over a minute to a week, on the hibr desktop (a
 drop-down on the menu bar, a Control Panel pane, a Control Strip module and
 a window) and on the command line. A service counts the interface traffic,
 captures packets read-only and joins each flow to the program that owns it.
 .
 This package is the engine (a hibr module), the launcher and the service.
 The scripts come from hibr's catalogue: `catalogue install wiretap`.

